'''Jhothal''' was the informal name of a small outpost and village located far from [[Capital City]], on the [[planet]] of [[Lothal]]. It was named after local [[Ithorian]] [[Old Jho's Pit Stop|cantina]] owner [[Jho|Old Jho]].<ref name="Rebels Epic Battles">''[[Star Wars Rebels: Visual Guide: Epic Battles]]''</ref>

